78	 * stacked editorial column with a trailing 2x2 supporting-shot grid; tablet and mobile share a
79	 * single-image swipeable carousel with dot navigation. Both breakpoints support
80	 * click-anywhere-to-open-the-full-gallery, confirmed against the Figma design walkthrough.
81	 *
82	 * Reusable beyond the PDP — takes a plain `media` sequence rather than the raw SFCC
83	 * `imageGroups` shape, so a caller maps its own product data at the call site (see
84	 * `product-view/index.tsx` for the PDP's mapping from `product.imageGroups`).
